    {
      "id": "31197840",
      "title": "Using the Created Context with useContext",
      "lectureOrder": 117,
      "videoOrder": 113,
      "sourceHash": "d658f20732d53d14aaede2ed2a0d4000361515a8d5d48f5c56aaf4d4f0a11915",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.15,
          "end": 4.26,
          "en": "So let's now use the context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 4.26,
          "end": 7.49,
          "en": "and let's start in the meal detail screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.49,
          "end": 10.26,
          "en": "That is the screen where we have this icon button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.26,
          "end": 11.313,
          "en": "which we can tap.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.22,
          "end": 14.93,
          "en": "And now I wanna make sure that when we tap this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 14.93,
          "end": 17.58,
          "en": "instead of just logging something to the console",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.58,
          "end": 20.25,
          "en": "we actually change the favorite status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 20.25,
          "end": 21.173,
          "en": "of that meal.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.4,
          "end": 24.5,
          "en": "For this, we need two things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.5,
          "end": 28.35,
          "en": "We need access to the methods to find in our context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 28.35,
          "end": 31.4,
          "en": "and we need access to the IDs to find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 31.4,
          "end": 33.99,
          "en": "if the ID that we got here for this meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 33.99,
          "end": 36.5,
          "en": "for which this screen was loaded,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.5,
          "end": 38.78,
          "en": "is part of our favorite meal IDs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 38.78,
          "end": 41.94,
          "en": "So if this meal for which this screen was loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.94,
          "end": 42.993,
          "en": "is a favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 43.98,
          "end": 46.16,
          "en": "We can get both things",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 46.16,
          "end": 48.7,
          "en": "by using another hook that's built into React,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 48.7,
          "end": 51.67,
          "en": "and that's the use context hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.67,
          "end": 54.63,
          "en": "And these context features which we are using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.63,
          "end": 56.87,
          "en": "defining context, using context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.87,
          "end": 60.24,
          "en": "that has nothing to do with React Native.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 60.24,
          "end": 63.26,
          "en": "These are all standard react features",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 63.26,
          "end": 66.503,
          "en": "and they work as they do in any React app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.52,
          "end": 70.34,
          "en": "Now use context will give us a context, in this case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 70.34,
          "end": 75.313,
          "en": "the favorite meal context or favorite meals context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 76.16,
          "end": 77.36,
          "en": "And we get this context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 77.36,
          "end": 82.36,
          "en": "by passing our context object into the use context hook.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.71000000000001,
          "end": 86.13,
          "en": "And with that, I'm talking about this object that we defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.13,
          "end": 88.46000000000001,
          "en": "in the favorites context file initially.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.46000000000001,
          "end": 90.203,
          "en": "This favorites context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 91.12,
          "end": 92.91,
          "en": "So in meal detail screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 92.91,
          "end": 96.62,
          "en": "we can pass favorites context into use context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 96.62,
          "end": 97.46000000000001,
          "en": "And for this, of course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 97.46000000000001,
          "end": 101.53999999999999,
          "en": "you need to make sure that you import favorites context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.53999999999999,
          "end": 103.93,
          "en": "Now with that imported,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 103.93,
          "end": 107.37,
          "en": "we got hold of our favorite meals context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 107.37,
          "end": 111.64,
          "en": "and with we now can do a couple of things.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 111.64,
          "end": 112.777,
          "en": "For example, we can find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 112.777,
          "end": 116.66,
          "en": "whether that meal currently is our favorite or not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 116.66,
          "end": 118.72999999999999,
          "en": "or one of our favorites.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 118.72999999999999,
          "end": 121.73,
          "en": "And I even wanna change the icon that we show here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.73,
          "end": 124.88,
          "en": "on the detail screen based on that information.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 124.88,
          "end": 127.65,
          "en": "If this meal is one of our favorites,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 127.65,
          "end": 130.36,
          "en": "we should have this filled star icon,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 130.36,
          "end": 133.813,
          "en": "but if it's not a favorite yet, I wanna have an empty star.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 135.02,
          "end": 137.94,
          "en": "Now that we got hold of the favorite meals context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 137.94,
          "end": 140.14,
          "en": "that is fairly easy to find out.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 140.14,
          "end": 144.18,
          "en": "We can add a new constant 'meal is favorite'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 144.18,
          "end": 145.75,
          "en": "which should be a Boolean,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 145.75,
          "end": 147.67000000000002,
          "en": "and to find out whether this meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 147.67000000000002,
          "end": 151.31,
          "en": "for which this screen was loaded now is a favorite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 151.31,
          "end": 154.5,
          "en": "we can use our favorite meals context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 154.5,
          "end": 156.083,
          "en": "so this constant here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 157.32,
          "end": 159.35,
          "en": "and access the IDs there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 159.35,
          "end": 164.223,
          "en": "and find out if in this IDs array, we have this meal ID.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 165.2,
          "end": 167.67000000000002,
          "en": "We can easily find out whether that's the case",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 167.67000000000002,
          "end": 169.41,
          "en": "by using the includes method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 169.41,
          "end": 172.36,
          "en": "which is a standard Java strip method,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 172.36,
          "end": 174.73,
          "en": "and we pass meal ID to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 174.73,
          "end": 178.02,
          "en": "Includes works great on primitive values,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 178.02,
          "end": 179.43,
          "en": "and it will return true",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 179.43,
          "end": 182.75,
          "en": "if this meal ID is part of this IDs array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 182.75,
          "end": 184.5,
          "en": "and false otherwise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 184.5,
          "end": 185.45,
          "en": "So now we can find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 185.45,
          "end": 188.12,
          "en": "whether this meal is a favorite or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 188.12,
          "end": 190.06,
          "en": "We can then use this on this button here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 190.06,
          "end": 192.12,
          "en": "to set our icon conditionally,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 192.12,
          "end": 195.98,
          "en": "instead of always setting it to the star icon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 195.98,
          "end": 197.85,
          "en": "We can use meal is favorite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 197.85,
          "end": 201.9,
          "en": "and then use the star icon if it is,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 201.9,
          "end": 203.98,
          "en": "so that's this filled star,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 203.98,
          "end": 207.09,
          "en": "but use star outline if it's not",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 207.09,
          "end": 209.153,
          "en": "and that will be an empty star.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 210.09,
          "end": 213.53,
          "en": "Now to actually change the favorite status,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 213.53,
          "end": 215.84,
          "en": "we have to work on this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 215.84,
          "end": 218.25,
          "en": "First of all, I will rename this function to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 218.25,
          "end": 220.94,
          "en": "'change favorite status handler'",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 220.94,
          "end": 223.55,
          "en": "because that sounds more appropriate.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 223.55,
          "end": 226.67000000000002,
          "en": "Now we'll update it here on the on press prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 226.67000000000002,
          "end": 230.203,
          "en": "and here in the dependencies array of use layout effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 231.27,
          "end": 232.97,
          "en": "And inside of this function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 232.97,
          "end": 236.69,
          "en": "we now can add a if check and check if meal is favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 236.69,
          "end": 238.69,
          "en": "So if the meal is a favorite",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 238.69,
          "end": 241.48,
          "en": "in which case we wanna unfavorite it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 241.48,
          "end": 246.48,
          "en": "And we do unfavorite it by using our favorite meals context,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 246.64,
          "end": 249.08,
          "en": "so again this context object,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 249.08,
          "end": 251.77,
          "en": "and calling the remove favorite method on it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 251.77,
          "end": 253.993,
          "en": "passing the meal ID to that method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 254.97,
          "end": 256.67,
          "en": "This would then switch this meal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 256.67,
          "end": 258.963,
          "en": "from favorite to non favorite.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 260.07,
          "end": 262.71,
          "en": "Else if the meal isn't our favorite at the moment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 262.71,
          "end": 264.42,
          "en": "but we clicked this button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 264.42,
          "end": 267.85,
          "en": "indicating that we wanna turn it into a favorite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 267.85,
          "end": 271.48,
          "en": "we would execute favorite meals context, add favorite,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 271.48,
          "end": 273.763,
          "en": "and pass our meal ID into this method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 274.65,
          "end": 277.31,
          "en": "So that is how we can toggle the favorite status.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 277.31,
          "end": 279.1,
          "en": "And this should already work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 279.1,
          "end": 280.773,
          "en": "and this should be all we need.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 281.77,
          "end": 286.753,
          "en": "If we save this and we force a reload of our app,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 287.61,
          "end": 289.46,
          "en": "if I go there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 289.46,
          "end": 293.01,
          "en": "you see I can toggle between these two star states",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 293.01,
          "end": 294.83,
          "en": "because indeed behind the scenes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 294.83,
          "end": 297.853,
          "en": "this favorite status of this meal is being changed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 298.98,
          "end": 300.86,
          "en": "Of course we don't just need that status",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 300.86,
          "end": 302.34,
          "en": "on this screen though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 302.34,
          "end": 304.74,
          "en": "We also want it on the favorite screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 304.74,
          "end": 306.88,
          "en": "and there at the moment we're not displaying",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 306.88,
          "end": 308.58,
          "en": "any favorite meals.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 308.58,
          "end": 309.713,
          "en": "Time to change this.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
